    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kurkú geera oo Dario, garmoó Ahasuero heé Medi, iwa waawuti'ín baraá yaamaá múk Kaldayoro, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anuú Danieli kitaaba'aá hhohho' ina soomuús, ngiri tsaáhh adór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa xu'utís dír aarusmo Yeremia daanduú kureeridaá mibeeri faanqwe, kudá' gixsár Yerusalemu kawa hhitin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Aakoó Mungú una firiím ar muunaáeé' sleémeero dinkwa nee gwaawito, tlabaá guniyadu ngiri dahaás nee niri iwiít baraá da/ara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúeé' una firiím, nee niri gwadidiím niwa kah:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aá Aáko, kuúng an Munguú úr nee oo ta da'ayumiti. Kuúng tu inkihhím daanduú alqadoroge, nee sla'aarirók i warqeeraaká dír kudá' kuúng u sla'a' nee hara'ayaarók ngi ilaiwawa/á'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Tlakweema iga tleehhaán nee aga dakusaán, muruú tlákw ugwa tleehhaán nee aga dee/anutaán. Hara'ayaarók nee dabeeroge aga siaán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sagadiyuuseerók tidár aaruuse aga iiárií qaasaniiká, tidá' aa axwes ar umuuwók dír waawitaárén nee mukrén oo urén nee xwayliteérén, nee xooroorén sleémeerowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aá Aáko, diroge gan'amu i deer, ala atén umuú deeloro mure taa fák. Kaangwí sleémeero a ló' dír ateéká' Yudeár hootá' nee yaamuloouusér Yerusalemuro, nee múk Israeli sleémeero kudá' taa diyá/ baraá yaamaá saawá' nee awa tsewene, asma inkihhimu nguwa dakuusiyé' diroge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, a mure direne, nee dír waawitaárene, nee geeraharuuserene nee bariiseerene, asma kuúng ugwa sadakusaán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aakoó Munguúrén, kuúng guruuwók i tlatláy nee tlakweemá muu in gurtleér tam handá' atén aga dee/anutani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúrén atén kuúng ugwa iialooeesaniiká, aga hootaniiká ar har afiqoomár dabeerók tidá' naa ó' ar loohír sagadiyuuseerók tidár aaruuse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Israeli sleémeero dabeerók gaa sií', kuúng ugwa geexayé', nee axweesantók ngaa iialooesi'iiká. Atén lo'odá' taa gooín baraá dabér Mose, sagadiyusmoowók, taa /ák, asma kuúng ugwa sadakusaán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Axweesantók tidá' taa ó' aga gawdés daandemoorene, nee dír waawitaárene, as gixsár Yerusalemu kawa ló'wa sláhh, ak alé ta gixsadaá hatlá' sleémeero awa daanduú yaamuwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atén kuúng taa múx ar adoodá' kara gooín baraá dabér Mosewo, ala tam hamí, aá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúrén, gurtleemuuwók ugwa firimaniiká as tlakweemaarén kiwa mawaan, nee looeemaawók iga eeharaniiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, kuúng tiri amohhe'és atén tiwa mux, nee adoorí kari tléhh. Asma kuúng AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, a ganá' baraá umuúqo gár ta tlehhita. Nee atén axweesantók aga iilooeesaniiká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Hám daxta, aá Aakoó Munguúrén, kuúngudá' mukók ngwaa dux baraá yaamaá Misrír wa ale, umuuwók kway iia tleerés ay laarí. Hamí an kaahaan atén aga dakusaán, tlakweema iga tleehhaán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aá Aáko, adoodá' tlehhmi'iiwók awa ganaa'á' i diri'iia atén miti i buhhaar, laqaá gixsarók ar Yerusalemu ma i buhhaar, tam tloomarók tidá' hhoohhoo'. Asma muu sleémeero kuduú inslaawaay gixsarók ar Yerusalemu nee mukoge kin waqaqaa' as tlakweemaadá' atén nee baabi'iirén naa tleehhaán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, Munguúeé', firór sagadiyusmoowók iiarí qaaseek as kuúng. Ar gurtleemuwoge didár hotaawók tidá' taa hhitín male gurtlaweek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aá Munguúeé', iia qaaseek, qaytsiít slahh'amuú ta koomaan, nee adór gixsarí taa umuuwók ar ateét ir slahhaahha'. Gár atén kuúng us firirimaan a gan'amuureneeká, ala a as gurtleemuuwók oo yaariír. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aá Aáko, atén ti iiárií qas, aá Aáko, atén ti gurtleer. Aá Aáko, ti iiárií qas, nee adoodá' ta sla' tleehheek, ala mindi tligaar as umuuwók, aá Munguúeé, as daanduú gixsarí nee mukwí taa umuuwók ar ateét.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Qoomár niwa firiím, niwa tlakweemaaeé' gwadidiim, nee tlakweemaá muk'eé' oo Israeli dinkwa nee AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúeé' nguwa i /aa/amiim as daanduú tloomár hhoohhoo' ar Munguúeé', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "heedaádá' ta bay Gabrieli, kudá' aáng naa geerií ár baraá iigu'utuwo, niri gaanslár /eét ay didá' aníng nay dirii'. Qoomaadá' an qoomár ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i ar tsiindo kawa hanmaamisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy iri báy, ‹Daniéli, aníng naa hardáh as uwa sagalooár i haniis nee tsaahha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár firo kawa iimu/uún, Mungú mu/aywatsa ngina haniís, aníng nina hardáh as mu/aywatsa ngiwa huuw, asma kuúng tu ló'wa slaa'. Gawaá adoorihe mu/aywatsatadá' iiarí qaaseek nee gár iigu'utudá' ka tsáhh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Afiqoomár wiikadaá mibeeri faanqw, kaa qaás as mukók nee daanduú gixsarók tidá' hhoohhoo' as dakuús kawa faaki, tlakweema kiwa gurtlay, nee gan'amuú alhhe'eesáy wasle kunguwa huwi iigu'utu nee aaru'uuma kiwa dugunó i qaasi, nee didá' ló'wa hhoohhoo' kawa di/tí qaasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe gaarí tsaahheek: Iimír qoomár hara'aya kawa oó' ar gixsár Yerusalemu kawa malé /abeesi tleehhamooro, ay qoomár heedaádá' úr taa iimbalaáx niwa hardihi, a har afiqoomár wiíkoó faanqw. Har afiqoomár wiikadaá mibeeri lahhoó' nee tsár gixsár Yerusalemu ka malé /abees tleehharo, nee loohduuwós kudá' uren nee boh'e ala qoomaarí a qoomár slahh'amu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.25"
